            <t index="516" torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:30,732</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:32,080</end-time>
                <translation>看到一页书上写着真理
真理について書いてあるっていうページだ、</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="517" torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:32,080</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:33,620</end-time>
                <translation>就以为“答案在这里”
これが答えだと思ってみたら</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="518" torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:33,620</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:35,737</end-time>
                <translation>结果却一点感觉也没有
例えばピンとこないっていうことは</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="519" torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:35,737</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:36,720</end-time>
                <translation>这种情况也没关系</translation>
                <original>あってよくて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="520" torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:36,720</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:39,307</end-time>
                <translation>因为也许有一天
でも何か自分の</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="521" torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:39,307</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:41,000</end-time>
                <translation>自己的状态已经准备好了
