                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="526" torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:49,217</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:52,218</end-time>
                <translation>只要你曾经知道这些话
いつかそのことを知ってると</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="527" torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:52,218</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:55,076</end-time>
                <translation>也许总有一天就能接近真理
いつか真理にたどり着く</translation>
